sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: HTTP Request Logging and OpenTelemetry Tracing Sequence
    accDescr: Sequence of an application endpoint call through Client and HTTPX with optional tracing spans and structured JSON logging
    participant App
    participant Client
    participant HTTPX
    App->>Client: call endpoint
    Client->>Client: start span (optional)
    Client->>HTTPX: send request
    HTTPX-->>Client: response
    Client->>Client: log JSON
    Client->>Client: end span (optional)
    Client-->>App: return result
